CLKC-24#1 Advisory
MMCME4 with ZHOLD drives sequential IO not with CLKOUT0  
The MMCME4 cell lvds/rx_mmcm has COMPENSATION value ZHOLD, but CLKOUT1 output drives sequential IO cells. In order to achieve insertion delay and phase-alignment for the IO sequential cells, CLKOUT0 must be used.
Related violations: <none>


